   "soundinstallation"
  ],
  "description": "Blending nature and city life, this unedited field recording from Berlin in the summer features the calls of a chiffchaff and a chaffinch intertwined with the sounds of the city. This recording can be used in films, computer games, documentaries, school projects, podcasts, sound installations, or as inspiration for blending natural and urban soundscapes.\n\nRecorded with a Sony PCM-D100. All my field recordings from summer 2024 in Berlin capture the interplay of bird and industrial sounds as they naturally occurred. Apart from trimming and slight overall volume adjustment, no additional editing has been applied.",
