  "description": "Description\nChorus and woodland birdsong recorded in a natural outdoor environment. Prominent species include Eurasian Blackcap, Common Blackbird, Common Chaffinch, Common Nightingale, European Robin, Carrion Crow, and Common Chiffchaff. A rich spring ambience with overlapping songs, chirping, and distant crow calls, suitable for nature ambience, documentaries, relaxation, and sound design.\n\nMeso\nNatural woodland ambience with multiple bird species singing simultaneously during the early morning chorus.\n\nMicro\nClear individual bird calls and melodic song phrases from Eurasian Blackcap, Common Blackbird, Common Chaffinch, Common Nightingale, European Robin, Carrion Crow, and Common Chiffchaff.\n\nTechnical\nRecorder: Android phone (RØDE Reporter app)\nMicrophone: RØDE VideoMic GO II\nProcessing: None",
